			(property "Description" "Red SMD LED\n\nUsed in manufacturing of most products at SparkFun\n\n• 0603 - SMD 0603 package\n\n• Forward Voltage: 1.9V\n\n• Forward Current: 20mA\n\n• Datasheet: http://docs.avagotech.com/docs/AV02-0551EN [Product Link]\n\n•\n\n• 0603 SMART - SMD 0603 SMART package ( more efficient and expensive)\n\n• Forward Voltage: 1.8V\n\n• Forward Current: 20mA\n\n• Datasheet: http://www.osram-os.com/Graphics/XPic2/00077099_0.pdf [Product Link]\n\n•\n\n• 1206 - SMD 1206 package\n\n• Forward Voltage: 2V\n\n• Forward Current: 20mA\n\n• Datasheet: https://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/DevTools/LilyPad/Q150OVS4.pdff [Product Link]\n\n•\n\n• 1206 LilyPad - SMD 1206 LilyPad package\n\n• Forward Voltage: 2V\n\n• Forward Current: 20mA\n\n• Datasheet: https://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/DevTools/LilyPad/Q150OVS4.pdf [Product Link]\n\n•"
